<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">In So Many Ways (In So Many Worlds)</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Thirty-one days,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;thirty-one universes,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;thirty-one snippets of the same lives led in not quite the same ways.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Â &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;OR&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;My drawing tablet broke so now Iâ€™m gonna write a bunch of different stories either making these guys suffer, have a good time, or something in the middle&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>BluefireBlaze</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
      <dc:subject>
        <rdf:Bag>
          <rdf:li>Fanworks</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Teen And Up Audiences</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>She-Ra and the Princesses of Power (2018)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora/Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Melog (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>for some reason Swift Wind just doesnâ€™t have a tag??</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Alternate Universe</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>but multiply that by 31</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Sheratober (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>but itâ€™s all AUs</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>i will in fact be abusing italics frequently and consistently</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Multi</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>No Archive Warnings Apply</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catraâ€™s a dog person</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adoraâ€™s a cat person</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Fluff and Angst</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Hurt/Comfort</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Bow/Glimmer (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Kyle/Rogelio (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>believe it or not i did not intend to spawn a brand new OC it just happened</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>they just exist now itâ€™s fine</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Swift Wind | Spirit</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>i have been corrected about Swift Windâ€™s tag apparently he does have one</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Bow (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Glimmer (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Scorpia (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Entrapta (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Lonnie (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Kyle (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Rogelio (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Tallstar (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Jewelstar (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Starla (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Glory (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>He-Man | Adam</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>AU-ctober 2024</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Sea Hawk (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Mermista (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Alternate Universe - College/University</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Alternate Universe - Medieval</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Alternate Universe - Fantasy</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Alternate Universe - Post-Apocalypse</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Alternate Universe - Crossover</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Five Nights at Freddy's</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Spider-Man - All Media Types</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Lunar Chronicles - Marissa Meyer</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Pokemon Mystery Dungeon</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Avatar: The Last Airbender (Cartoon 2005)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>The Owl House (Cartoon)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Persona 5</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Alternate Universe - Canon Divergence</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>the other fandoms listed are ONLY for Crossover Week</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>this is very much primarily a She-Ra fic</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Bag>
